									<p>
									I hold a Bachelor’s degree in Computer Engineering with a strong foundation in software systems, cybersecurity, and mobile computing. 
									My academic and professional experience includes secure iOS application development and fintech research, notably my involvement in a national Central Bank Digital Currency project. 
									Beyond academics, I was a Top 7 finalist and Most Creative Award recipient at Mister Nepal 2025, a leadership and personality development platform, reflecting my ability to lead and communicate ideas. 
									My research interests include cybersecurity, blockchain, applied cryptography, AI/ML-driven security, and scalable software systems.
									</p>


								</header>

