							<div class="content">
								<h2>Digital Mobile Banking Solutions</h2>
								<p>A high-impact platform utilized by the country's major banks. Beyond building dynamic views and core transaction modules, I was responsible for engineering the app’s high-security architecture. This included implementing biometric encryption by securing user data in Keychain, and developing a robust jailbreak detection system. Furthermore, I optimized the app’s operational stability by performing deep CPU profiling and memory management, ensuring that the high-throughput transaction engine remained performant and leak-free across all devices.<br />
									<!-- <a href="https://github.com/SabalKatuwal/eLibrary" target="_blank">eLibrary</a></p> -->
								</p>
							</div>
						</section>

						<section class="spotlight">
							
							<div class="scrollable-images">
								<img src="images/collegeApp1.png" alt="" />
								<img src="images/collegeApp2.png" alt="" />
								<img src="images/collegeApp3.png" alt="" />
								<img src="images/collegeApp4.png" alt="" />
								<img src="images/collegeApp5.png" alt="" />
								<img src="images/collegeApp6.png" alt="" />
							</div>
							<div class="content">
								<h2>College App</h2>
								<p>The College App, built in Swift, incorporates PDFKit, SwiftData, Core Animation, and Keychain
									Storage. It features discussions, MCQ solving, note-taking, and notifications for an enhanced
									educational experience.<br />
									<a href="https://apps.apple.com/np/app/bright-acca-app/id6633416060" target="_blank">College App</a></p>
									
							</div>
						</section>
							
						<section class="spotlight">
							<div class="scrollable-images">
								<img src="images/bankApp.png" alt="" />
								<img src="images/bankApp0.png" alt="" />
								<img src="images/bankApp1.png" alt="" />
								<img src="images/bankApp2.png" alt="" />
								<img src="images/bankApp3.png" alt="" />
								<img src="images/bankApp4.png" alt="" />
								<img src="images/bankApp5.png" alt="" />
								<img src="images/bankApp6.png" alt="" />
							</div>
							<div class="content">
								<h2>eWallet App</h2>
								<p>The eWallet App, integrates Central Bank Digital Currency (CBDC). It employs blockchain technology and public key cryptography for robust security, enabling real-time, end-to-end token transfers.<br />
									<!-- <a href="https://github.com/SabalKatuwal/Landmark" target="_blank">Landmark App</a></p> -->
									
							</div>
