							<div class="content">
								<h2>Landmark App</h2>
								<p>The Landmark app is developed using SwiftUI. The app has smooth animations and transitions and also uses new @Observable macro. This app serves as a comprehensive demonstration of SwiftUI's capabilities and best practices.<br />
									<a href="https://github.com/SabalKatuwal/Landmark" target="_blank">Landmark App</a></p>
									
