						<section class="spotlight">
							<div class="scrollable-video">
								<video width="430" height="430" controls>
									<source src="images/8PuzzleGame1.mp4" type="video/mp4">
									Your browser does not support the video tag.
								</video>
							</div>
							<div class="content">
								<h2>8-Puzzle Game</h2>
								<p>The 8-Puzzle Game app is designed to solve the classic 8-puzzle problem using a dynamic A* search algorithm. The app features heuristic search algorithms, AI problem-solving techniques, dynamic UI elements, and state space management. The goal is to optimize graph traversal for the most efficient path from the initial to the end state.<br />
								<a href="https://github.com/SabalKatuwal/8-Puzzle-Game" target="_blank">8-Puzzle-Game</a></p>
							</div>
